# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Room 003 (ROOM4060), through the bathroom door - the way the story has them:
# the bathroom is the notch in its L. Its RDT puts the door to the bathroom on
# its corridor's wall at z 4050; it is moved by (-304, +1104) so that wall
# backs onto the bathroom's far wall and the two doors are one. Walls from its
# own collision records, moved the same; the furniture is blocked out where
# its records are, as the pictures show it: a desk at the corridor's end, a
# bed against each wall of the bedroom, a rug between them. Blue light.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
